Recommended implementation stack
  1. exact source-marked reachability target (THM-381)
  2. certificate-gate DAG with Cprime/Phi/P(S) terminal calls (THM-398/HYP-2112/HYP-2108)
  3. A^2 cache for small quotient-class lookup, canonical fallback outside range
  4. SCC/good-cut/private-leaf peeling on endpoint-owner proof graphs
  5. L/M/R middle automata so only live middle cells receive CRT/metric detail
  6. threshold-colored section/fiber pre-sieves before exact interval search
